// Zip A Folder With PowerShell For Staging In Temp - PowerShell Script | T1074.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_susp_zip_compress.yml
powershell.file.script_block_text:(*Compress\-Archive\ \-Path*\-DestinationPath\ $env\:TEMP* OR *Compress\-Archive\ \-Path*\-DestinationPath*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\* OR *Compress\-Archive\ \-Path*\-DestinationPath*\:\\Windows\\Temp\\*)
